I've started noticing bad websites everywhere.

Not because I'm trying to.

It's just hard to unsee things once you start paying attention to UX.

Confusing navigation, unnecessary pop-ups, buttons that don't look clickable, forms asking for information they don't need...

Now I can't visit some websites without thinking, "Why did they make me do this?"

I guess that's what happens when you start getting into UX.

